    "description": "If you're a passionate Front Office Manager with drive and ambition, SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates in Gurgaon is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates:\nSOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Plan and execute banquets, events, and MICE functions\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Train and supervise front-line staff on service standards\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in GDS Systems\n• Proficiency in OTA Management\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Flexible working hours\n• Referral bonus program\n• Professional development and training programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gurgaon, Haryana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates!",
